  "description": {
    "raw": "You become a larger, awful version of yourself. You grow to size Large, and take on features that horrify your enemies. You gain the following abilities: a +6 size bonus to Strength, a +4 size bonus to Constitution, a +6 natural armor bonus, DR 10/magic, and spell resistance equal to 10 + half your caster level. You also emit an aura that emanates 30 feet from you. Enemy creatures within the aura are shaken. Each time a creature shaken by this aura hits you with a melee attack, that creature becomes frightened for 1d4 rounds, though at the end of that duration it is no longer affected by this aura. The aura’s effect is a fear and mind-affecting effect.",
    "search_text": "\"you become a larger, awful version of yourself. you grow to size large, and take on features that horrify your enemies. you gain the following abilities: a +6 size bonus to strength, a +4 size bonus to constitution, a +6 natural armor bonus, dr 10/magic, and spell resistance equal to 10 + half your caster level. you also emit an aura that emanates 30 feet from you. enemy creatures within the aura are shaken. each time a creature shaken by this aura hits you with a melee attack, that creature becomes frightened for 1d4 rounds, though at the end of that duration it is no longer affected by this aura. the aura’s effect is a fear and mind-affecting effect.\"",
